### PCN-20250616 — *“TE0726-04 FTDI EEPROM update”* (issue date **2025-06-16**)

* **What changed:** FTDI EEPROM contents (MISC1 / AMD licence key) updated to match FTDI programming conventions required by AMD tools (UG980 / Vivado Hardware Manager changes) so the programmer is identified properly (prefix `TE`). **Why:** new FTDI programming method in AMD tools (>= 2022.2). **Impact:** improves Vivado / Hardware Manager compatibility and device identification during JTAG. Affected modules: TE0726-04 with serial > 967172. ([Trenz Electronic][5])

