# Production / supply items you should track

* **Serial number ranges** (for PCN applicability; e.g., FTDI EEPROM update applies to TE0726-04 serials > 967172). ([Trenz Electronic][5])
* **SPI flash temp rating change** (−40..+105 → −40..+85 °C) in PCN-20250203 — important if you target industrial-temperature deployments. ([Mouser Electronics][3])
* **DDR timing / part swaps** (PCN-20210121 and PCN-20230619) — if your firmware makes timing assumptions, re-test. ([Trenz Electronic][4])

