# Short list of “gotchas” (things people trip on)

* **QSPI programming failures with Vivado** — Trenz explicitly added a JTAG-only switch to address this. If you skip that, you may get stuck flashing images on some tool versions. ([Mouser Electronics][2])
* **Device ID / temperature change in SPI flash** — some automated programming/CI scripts detect flash by JEDEC ID; the swap will show a new ID. ([Mouser Electronics][3])
* **ECC wiring & I²C connection** — rev-4 wires ECC EEPROM I²C onto available I²C bus via a level shifter — verify whether your carrier drives that same bus or if you need to avoid bus contention. ([Mouser Electronics][2])

